cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this census, these measurements or the scripts, please cite it as below."
title: "mcp-supply-audit: a reproducible evidence layer for the MCP and agent-tool ecosystem"
abstract: >-
  Read-only census of the public MCP registry with the field and value behind
  every finding, plus independent measurements of published agent-security rule
  sets against their own ground truth, and coordinated disclosure of defects
  found in those tools.
